        {
          "body": "This is the link from the Evaluate step. Negate it: plumper beans do not enhance the quality of a dish. Then skipping the soak buys nothing on the quality side, and the conclusion has no support.\n\nThe pattern to repeat: find the idea that appears only in the conclusion (quality), find the idea it replaced in the evidence (plumper beans), and look for the answer that connects them.",
